---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="About Hammad Sid, Unity developer building multiplayer VR and browser games.">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">About</h1>

  <div class="prose prose-invert mt-8 max-w-2xl prose-a:text-accent-2">
    <p>
      I'm Hammad, a Unity and indie game developer. I work mostly in C#, and I build multiplayer VR
      applications and browser games.
    </p>
    <p>
      I publish games on itch.io, and I've used Photon for multiplayer VR. Alongside game development I
      do freelance work, including CAD and technical drafting.
    </p>

    <h2>What I work with</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Engines:</strong> Unity, Phaser 3</li>
      <li><strong>Languages:</strong> C#, JavaScript/TypeScript</li>
      <li><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Photon</li>
      <li><strong>Mobile:</strong> React Native / Expo</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
    <p>
      Find me on <a href="https://github.com/HammadSiddiq" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>,
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hammadmsiddique/" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>, and
      <a href="https://www.upwork.com/freelancers/~0189f791d8afe7a799" rel="noopener">Upwork</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
